Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have to get him home to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been blowing a big check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's taken its toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind you, I've helped him spend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think someone's pants are getting a bit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to get him home
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,before something happens outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't forget the letter for Elisabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to take a letter up to Elisabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you maybe deliver it? Huh?
